body:
I have a fix here (quarkusio/quarkus#3068) that will fix the first half of your problem (well, technically it fixes the last `Caused by:` in your quoted stack trace).  To fix the second half (the part under the `Suppressed:` heading), you'll need to make a change to this code:

```java
    @BuildStep
    @Record(ExecutionTime.STATIC_INIT)
    BeanContainerListenerBuildItem processBuildTimeConfig(KafkaStreamsTemplate template) {
        Config config = ConfigProvider.getConfig();

        Properties properties = new Properties();
        for (String property : config.getPropertyNames()) {
            // Change this part to:
            if (property.startsWith("kafka.") { // no idea if this is the right prefix though
                properties.setProperty(property, config.getValue(property, String.class));
            }
        }

        return new BeanContainerListenerBuildItem(template.configure(properties));
    }

```

Otherwise you will include a number of extra properties that you might not want.  Also, you should wrap that code with:

```java
boolean old = ExpandingConfigSource.setExpanding(false);
try {
    // ... do the work here ...
} finally {
    ExpandingConfigSource.setExpanding(old);
}
```

Otherwise if you have property references in those properties, they'll get expanded, leading you back to the same error again.
